     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">i.	Organise one district-level workshop for all departments in Aspirational District Kiphire &#x2013; pilot district for developing District Indicator Framework (DIF)
ii.	Finalis DIF
iii.	Publish IEC material such as brochures, videos and pamphlets on SDGs in Nagaland
iv.	Publish Nagaland SDG Vision document 2030
v.	Publish a newsletter for COVID-19 response and awareness on SDGs
vi.	Establish SDG monitoring dashboard 
vii.	Publish District Manuals &#x2013; SDG localization and integration</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">i.	Conducted one district-level workshop for all departments in Aspirational District Kiphire &#x2013; Pilot District for developing District Indicator Framework (DIF)
ii.	Developed DIF for monitoring SDGs at the district level
iii.	Published a brochure &#x2013; Building Stewardship on Agenda 2030 in North East for awareness generation on SDGs; developed publicity material for dissemination of SDGs &#x2013; flyers, posters, handbook, radio jingle; developed promotional video on SDGs to generate greater awareness public 
iv.	Designed and published Nagaland SDG Vision document 2030: Set an ambition/roadmap for the state in order to achieve Agenda 2030
v.	Published newsletter for COVID-19 response and awareness on SDGs
vi.	Developed SDG monitoring dashboard: Enhance monitoring and evaluation at the state and district level
vii.	Developed District Manual - SDG localization and integration to improve local planning, implementation, monitoring of on-ground programmes</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
